# Implementation Plan - Profile Settings Editing & Audit Log Export (PDF / TXT)

This plan addresses two tasks:
1. **Profile Settings**: Ensure ONLY the email address is non-modifiable. All other user profile fields (Username, Full Name, Password, Date of Birth, Mobile Number, Address/Organization) must be fully editable.
2. **Audit Logs**: Upgrade Audit Log functionality to provide two distinct download formats (**PDF** and **Text**) with clear, readable entries containing exact **Date**, **Time**, **Place/IP Location**, and **Action Details**.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Email Non-Modifiability Policy**:
> The Email Address field will remain locked (disabled/read-only) as the primary user identity token, while Username, Password, Full Name, DOB, Mobile Phone, and Address/Organization will be editable and persisted to the MySQL database.
>
> **Audit Log Formats**:
> Replaces the previous `.enc` encrypted binary format with two user-selectable formats:
> 1. **PDF Document (.pdf)**: Structured SOC report using ReportLab with tables, headers, and metadata.
> 2. **Plain Text Log (.txt)**: Clean structured text file with line-by-line Date, Time, Location/IP, and Description logs.

