## Proposed Changes

### Backend Logic

#### [MODIFY] [backend/admin_routes.py](file:///d:/HACK-LEARNATHONS/LEARNATHON%20SLOT%203/FINAL/PRO/PRO/backend/admin_routes.py)
- **Profile Route (`/api/admin/profile`)**:
  - Update GET: Return `username`, `email` (read-only), `full_name`, `phone`, `organization`, `dob`, `address`, and `notification_email`.
  - Update POST: Accept edits for `username`, `full_name`, `phone`, `organization`, `dob`, `address`, `notification_email`, and optional `new_password`.
  - Update `users` table (`username`, `dob`, `password_hash`) and `user_profiles` table (`full_name`, `phone`, `organization`, `notification_email`, `address`).
- **Audit Log Route (`/api/admin/audit-log`)**:
  - Accept query parameter `format` (`pdf` or `txt`).
  - Fetch audit records with timestamp, action, description, and `ip_address` (formatting IP into place/location string).
  - If `format == 'pdf'`: Generate formatted ReportLab PDF containing Date, Time, Location, User, and Action details.
  - If `format == 'txt'`: Generate readable UTF-8 text file with structured date/time/place headers.

